      ],
      "text": "Declaration and management",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        75.58094787597656,
        296.53814697265625,
        106.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "of conflicts of interest",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.95880126953125,
        526.6732788085938,
        180.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "All the contributors completed a WHO declaration of interests form. All the declarations were evaluated by",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.95880126953125,
        526.7183837890625,
        194.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "three members of the Steering Group for any financial conflict of interest that might warrant exclusion from",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.95880126953125,
        526.6433715820312,
        208.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "membership of the Guidelines Development or Peer Review Group or from discussions during preparation of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.95880126953125,
        526.62744140625,
        222.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "the guidelines. Intellectual conflict of interest was not considered a motive for exclusion from membership",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.95880126953125,
        526.67041015625,
        236.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "of the Guidelines Development Group, as broad expertise on latent tuberculosis (TB) was considered a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        237.95880126953125,
        526.72021484375,
        250.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "criterion for selection. In addition, the diversity and representation in the Group was considered large enough",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.95880126953125,
        526.6703491210938,
        264.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "to balance and overcome any potential intellectual conflict of interest. The biographies of the GDG members",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        265.95880126953125,
        526.7342529296875,
        278.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "were made public before the meeting, in line with WHO’s policy on conflicts of interest. The completed forms",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.95880126953125,
        526.71240234375,
        292.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "were reviewed at the beginning of the meeting of the Guidelines Development Group, at which time members",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.95880126953125,
        202.4810791015625,
        306.7587890625
      ],
      "text": "could update their declarations.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.9176940917969,
        246.11648559570312,
        338.7007141113281
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines Development Group",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.6360168457031,
        526.6763305664062,
        357.4360046386719
      ],
      "text": "The following Guidelines Development Group members declared interests, which were judged to be in no",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.6360168457031,
        526.7362670898438,
        371.4360046386719
      ],
      "text": "conflict with the policy of WHO or the objectives of the meeting; none of the members declared commercial",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        372.6360168457031,
        441.4270935058594,
        385.4360046386719
      ],
      "text": "financial interests that were directly or indirectly related to the objectives of the meeting.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        392.3060302734375,
        526.6992797851562,
        405.10601806640625
      ],
      "text": "Padmapriyadarsini Chandrasekaran declared that her employer received research grants for the Model",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        406.3060302734375,
        197.215087890625,
        419.10601806640625
      ],
      "text": "DOTS Project from USAID.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        425.9760437011719,
        526.6831665039062,
        438.7760314941406
      ],
      "text": "Diana Gibb declared that she was coordinating a trial centre for the TB CHAMP trial, which is funded by",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        439.9760437011719,
        515.7063598632812,
        452.7760314941406
      ],
      "text": "the Medical Research Council, the Department for International Development and the Wellcome Trust.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        459.64605712890625,
        526.683349609375,
        472.446044921875
      ],
      "text": "Stephen Graham declared that he had received remuneration from the Challenge TB for providing technical",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        473.64605712890625,
        526.5970458984375,
        486.446044921875
      ],
      "text": "assistance in training and implementation of child contact screening and preventive therapy in Viet Nam",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        487.64605712890625,
        526.689208984375,
        500.446044921875
      ],
      "text": "between 2012 and 2016. He is currently a co-investigator in the V-QUIN and received research grants from",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        501.64605712890625,
        526.6021728515625,
        514.446044921875
      ],
      "text": "the National Health and Medical Research Council, Australia. He is also a co-principal investigator of the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        515.6460571289062,
        526.6882934570312,
        528.446044921875
      ],
      "text": "DETECT Child TB (child TB diagnosis, treatment and prevention) in Uganda and received research grants",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        529.6460571289062,
        479.1802062988281,
        542.446044921875
      ],
      "text": "from ELMA Philanthropies and the International Union Against Tuberculosis and Lung Disease.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        549.3160400390625,
        526.6061401367188,
        562.1160278320312
      ],
      "text": "Diane Havlir declared that she received research support from National Institutes of Health for research",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        563.3160400390625,
        111.61910247802734,
        576.1160278320312
      ],
      "text": "on TB.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        582.986083984375,
        526.65625,
        595.7860717773438
      ],
      "text": "Marieke van der Werf declared that she was an employee of the European Centre for Disease Prevention",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        596.986083984375,
        526.6636352539062,
        609.7860717773438
      ],
      "text": "and Control, which has an interest in the management of LTBI. She was an opponent in defense of a PhD",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        610.986083984375,
        421.0851135253906,
        623.7860717773438
      ],
      "text": "thesis that included studies on LTBI and received a remuneration of DKK 6741.16.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        630.6560668945312,
        526.67626953125,
        643.4560546875
      ],
      "text": "Wim Vandevelde declared that he was the chair of the Global TB Community Advisory Board on a voluntary",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        644.6560668945312,
        467.021240234375,
        657.4560546875
      ],
      "text": "basis. He stated that he represented the interests and needs of communities affected by TB.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        664.3260498046875,
        368.22625732421875,
        677.1260375976562
      ],
      "text": "The remaining members of the Group declared no conflicts of interests.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.2799072265625,
        195.94039916992188,
        709.0629272460938
      ],
      "text": "External Review Group",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        714.9982299804688,
        526.6082763671875,
        727.7982177734375
      ],
      "text": "The following External Review Group member declared interests that were judged to be in no conflict with the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.9982299804688,
        137.97113037109375,
        741.7982177734375
      ],
      "text": "policy of WHO:",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        748.668212890625,
        526.6622924804688,
        761.4682006835938
      ],
      "text": "Michael Kimerling declared that his employer received grants for research on a 3-month regimen of weekly",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03609466552734,
        762.668212890625,
        469.6802673339844,
        775.4682006835938
      ],
      "text": "rifapentine plus isoniazid from USAID and for implementation of the regimen from UNITAID.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        552.8067016601562,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "vii",
